  "summary": "asyncpg vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that asyncpg incorrectly handled certain array data\nreturned by a PostgreSQL server. A remote attacker controlling a PostgreSQL\nserver could possibly use this issue to cause asyncpg to crash, resulting\nin a denial of service, or execute arbitrary code.",
